00:34:17.013 --> 00:34:17.933
Cepatlah pergi.

00:34:18.132 --> 00:34:18.933
Aku sudah beritahu padamu.

00:34:18.933 --> 00:34:19.712
Tuan Jiao Tong

00:34:19.712 --> 00:34:20.612
tidak menerima tamu hari ini.

00:34:20.612 --> 00:34:21.333
Segera pergi.

00:34:22.132 --> 00:34:23.013
Jiaotong,

00:34:23.453 --> 00:34:24.453
hari ini aku datang

00:34:24.453 --> 00:34:26.212
untuk menyelesaikan persaingan kita.

00:34:26.212 --> 00:34:27.973
- Dia...
- Kurang ajar sekali!

00:35:41.692 --> 00:35:43.092
Anda yang meminta ini.

00:35:52.732 --> 00:35:54.813
Orang bodoh yang sombong.

00:35:58.772 --> 00:35:59.712
Fengyi

00:35:59.712 --> 00:36:00.893
terletak di utara Kota Yi.

00:36:01.053 --> 00:36:02.212
